<title>SINGAPORE: Equant wins S$43.2 mln deal from Shell.</title>
<headline>Equant wins S$43.2 mln deal from Shell.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equant Asia-Pacific, a business network services provider, said on Friday it had signed an agreement with Royal Dutch Shell Group to build a telecommunications network worth Singapore $43.2 million.</p>
<p>The network will link Shell's offices around the world and involve up to 100 sites, Equant said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
